⬇️FULL RECIPE⬇️
233 calories 22g protein (for the entire pint, mix-ins/toppings included)

High Protein Snowdrift Blizzard 😋🍦

Full recipe book (160+ flavors) linked in bio!

- 400g Fat Free High Protein Milk
- 40-45g Monk Fruit sweetener
- 5g (1 tsp) cake batter extract
- A pinch of salt
- 1g (¼ tsp) xanthan gum
- 1-2 drops blue food coloring (optional)
Mix-ins/toppings:
- 3 Oreo Thins (cream removed)
- 10g mini lucky-charms-style marshmallows (I used the ones from Jet Puffed)
233 cal 31g C, 1g F, 22g P

Instructions:
1. Blend all ingredients for the base and freeze (at least 16 hours)
2. Run your pint under hot water for at least 60 seconds
3. Spin on “Lite Ice Cream” setting
4. Spin on “Respin” setting if very powdery
5. Make a hole down to the bottom with a butter knife and fill with the Oreos and half of the marshmallows
6. Run the “Mix-in” cycle
7. Top with the rest of the marshmallows

